  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During the eagle hound battle for Lang Ya, Fang Yuan stops attacking long enough to fire the immortal killer move: rank seven year Gu first, then supplementary mortal Gu, until a River of Time phantom opens and an ancient year beast jumps out.",
      "chapters": [
        1137
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "gu_year_gu",
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Fan true inheritance records twelve year beast forms; that cast brings a chicken year beast, and Hei Fan invented the move long before refining Years Flow Like Water. The summoned beast is not a slave: if the enemy is too strong it may refuse to fight, or retreat and demand more year Gu, so the move suits a favorable battle more than a life-or-death disadvantage.",
      "chapters": [
        1138
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_hei_fan_true_inheritance",
        "char_hei_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later he can resummon when one beast flees; each ordinary cast still brings only one beast at a time.",
      "chapters": [
        1259
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Fan’s true inheritance details two cores: ordinary year Gu, and rank eight Years Flow Like Water. With Years Flow Like Water unsealed, the same named move summons an army instead of one beast and works as a time path method with enslavement path effect for attrition.",
      "chapters": [
        1401
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dual-core-versions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_years_flow_like_water"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Its flaw remains that the beasts are not loyal slaves; under pressure they try to retreat into the River of Time, and Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s methods outclass Hei Fan’s design even though the move’s strength is still real.",
      "chapters": [
        1402
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dual-core-versions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among Hei Fan methods that use Years Flow Like Water as core, the rank eight version can summon immemorial year beasts.",
      "chapters": [
        1602
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dual-core-versions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
